{"reviewId": "230585179_867UvD65M", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "比如你是一个造车的公司，因为你发明了流水线造车，使得你的效率大大提升，但是当市场需求已经超过你的效率的时候，你不得不建厂房、扩产线，增加资本投资，这时候你依然一家独大，控制着整个市场。但是过了几十年，突然出现了一个新的工业体系，他们不止用流水线，还加上了机械臂，这时候产能突然扩大，导致了造车的钢铁等原材料涨价，于是市场越来越小，原材料越来越贵，导致公司不得不裁员、减产能、甚至破产。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "4566-4660", "abstract": "造成资源需求的边际上升，而以前在资源品价格处于低位时供给没有得到充分准备，这带来供需边际变化短期内的不平衡，资源约束启动，价格迅速上升，这一点一旦与资本收益率的下降相契合就会发生经济冲击。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "230585179_867UvD65M", "userVid": 230585179, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768299905, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 230585179, "name": "Jerry", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0009-5r0e36ypfsBhd3oQaqsMm10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "山止川行", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-3000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 3000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 444640964, "name": "像风一样", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/8VibZbBIDaeBE3aabv4L5zYCme9Cw58gG7qQumaM2YKOCZbEEjYLOlMctXVsxN8fO7KicNwmyoBa4BaSeIk6AA7RvKmmUUJ5t07BpdPh73EAU/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "像风一样", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240909-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotCom